# Checkpoint — 2026-09-10 — Track 6 Item 3 Slice 1 — Generic Session Action Eligibility

Status: **COMPLETE / GREEN**

## Scope

This checkpoint closes only the first bounded Slice of approved Track 6 item 3 — session optimizer actions.

The Slice adds a passive, read-only eligibility boundary for explicitly supplied generic Guardian session-action candidates. It does **not** add mutation, action synthesis, ranking, canary execution, snapshot/rollback execution, cooldown, Action Budget, learned reliability, persistence, History writes, startup behavior or WPF changes.

