## Authority boundary

This Slice proves **eligibility only**.

It does not choose a winner among multiple eligible candidates. It does not rank by learned reliability. It does not execute any candidate. It does not call the existing BlueStacks canary executor. It does not mutate a process/system setting. It does not create a micro-snapshot. It does not keep or rollback anything. Existing specialized Guardian/BlueStacks behavior remains untouched.

